        "900 block of Old Steese Highway, Fairbanks, Oct. 31 at 2:27 p.m.; Fairbanks Police. Police case 26003325.",
        "A court file was opened behind the arrest on Nov. 1, case 4FA-26-02207CR, with arraignment set for Nov. 6. No charging document has been filed on it, so no charge stands against her on the court record."
